 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Resolution independence, identities, and pasting",
 "statement": "The class $\\operatorname{Ex}_{\\square,K}$ is independent of the injective\nresolution and is compatible with identity squares, horizontal pasting, and\nvertical pasting.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-proper-base-change/sk-def-exchange/lemma-weil-pbc-derived-exchange-coherence.md",
